>
<div class="wrap"><section class="page-title"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-route="home" class="" >首页</a><span>/</span><a href="/research/" data-route="research" class="" >Research</a><span>/</span><span>后训练</span></div><p class="eyebrow">POST-TRAINING</p><h1 class="zh-title">后训练，<br>一个持续展开的问题。</h1><p>围绕模型的后训练方法与评估，研究能力、行为与目标之间的联系。</p></section><article class="article-layout"><aside class="article-aside"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH FIELD / 05</p><p>研究方向说明<br>论文条目尚未录入</p><span class="tag">后训练</span></aside><div class="article-content"><h2>从问题出发</h2><p>如何通过明确的数据、目标与评估，把模型行为引向期望的任务？</p><div class="article-visual"><svg viewBox="0 0 380 250" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="193" cy="140" rx="113" ry="49" transform="rotate(0 193 140)" stroke="#7f9cb9" stroke-opacity=".35" stroke-width=".7"/><ellipse cx="193" cy="140" rx="113" ry="49" transform="rotate(60 193 140)" stroke="#7f9cb9" stroke-opacity=".35" stroke-width=".7"/><ellipse cx="193" cy="140" rx="113" ry="49" transform="rotate(-60 193 140)" stroke="#7f9cb9" stroke-opacity=".35" stroke-width=".7"/><circle cx="242.0" cy="75.8" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="242.0" cy="75.8" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="301.0" cy="140.0" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="301.0" cy="140.0" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="260.1" cy="196.4" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="260.1" cy="196.4" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="148.1" cy="205.5" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="148.1" cy="205.5" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="85.2" cy="135.8" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="85.2" cy="135.8" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="122.4" cy="85.5" r="5" fill="#0d131d" stroke="#9bb9d3" stroke-width=".8"/><circle cx="122.4" cy="85.5" r="1.8" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="193" cy="140" r="32" fill="#d6b881" fill-opacity=".035" stroke="#d6b881" stroke-opacity=".6"/><path d="M193 119L212 150H174Z" stroke="#d6b881" stroke-width=".7"/><circle cx="193" cy="140" r="3" fill="#d6b881"/></svg></div><h3>这里将呈现怎样的研究？</h3><p>正式内容应从真实论文出发，说明所研究的问题、主要方法、适用假设与局限，并把核心原理解释清楚。原理动画应服务于论证，而不是替代证据。</p><h3>从可读到可复现</h3><p>计划为每篇精选论文提供题目、作者、发表信息、摘要、贡献说明、论文链接、代码与引用格式。实验结果需要同时给出数据集、基线、配置与评估协议。</p><p class="article-note">该页面是研究方向的展示模板，不是某篇已发表论文的介绍。为避免误导，当前不展示未经提供和核验的论文标题、成绩或合作机构。</p><a href="/collaborate/" data-route="collaborate" class="button button-primary" >发起相关研究讨论 <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></article></div>
</Layout>
